"#1C1F23", width: 190}}>长程记忆</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>跨轮任务不失忆</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", width: 100}}>在演进</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 22}}>所有成品都把这四样当卖点——这是整个品类在那一圈上投的票。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>22 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
